# Test: spki-pin (now in net.llt) accepts any algorithm variant and fingerprint bytes
# Algorithm validation is deferred to tls-connect which validates pins at connection time
--- uses: ["core"]
[include %libdir "net.llt"]

[InvalidAlgorithm: [variant "InvalidAlgorithm"]]
[pin: [spki-pin InvalidAlgorithm [bytes-of [65 66 67]]]]
[tag-of pin.algorithm]

=== out
String("InvalidAlgorithm")

=== warn
[UndefinedVariable] undefined variable: spki-pin
